<title>HONG KONG: Morgan launches Cheung Kong warrants.</title>
<headline>Morgan launches Cheung Kong warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley (Jersey) Ltd said on Monday it launched 31.7 million warrants on shares of Cheung Kong (Holdings) Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE   HK$66.15	  PREMIUM	    14.4 pct</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE    HK $1.796	 GEARING	    4.1 times</p>
<p> EXPIRATION     Nov 5, 1998     PAYDATE	    May 16, 1997</p>
<p> LISTING May 21, 1997 MIN EXER LOT 10,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE HK$73.50</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
